#note "Round 2026-10-15 review M4 (the find_vars exclusion S4 Q3 pinned, on the no-APERIOD path): no APERIOD; ADSL carries TRT01A (Placebo) and TRT1A (Xanomeline High Dose, a non-IG width). find_vars(\"ADSL.TRTxxA\") is two-digit, so exactly ONE TRTxxA counts and TRTA is compared with TRT01A -> fires. Were TRT1A counted, the count would be 2 and the record skipped; were it a member, TRTA would match it."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
